\subsection{Statistical and Interpretability Analysis}
Pairwise AUROC differences (DeLong's test) were as follows:
\begin{itemize}
    \item XGBoost vs. LightGBM: ΔAUROC = 0.008 (95 \% CI 0.005-0.011; p < 0.001).
    \item Clinical vs. MRI models: ΔAUROC = 0.108 (95\% CI 0.095-0.121; p < 0.001).
\end{itemize}

The ensemble maintained AUROC = 0.920 while reducing variance by 32\% relative to ClinicalNet (Gradient Boosting) alone.

